codex
**Defects**

- **CHECK CANNOT FAIL** — line 856.  
  Input: `RAPIDMETA_REPO_ROOT=<empty dir>` and `main(["x","--all"])`.  
  Consequence: scans `0 file(s)` and returns 0, so a mispointed corpus gate passes without checking anything.

- **CHECK CANNOT FAIL / DIFFERENT COPY** — line 496.  
  Input: `scan('<script>window.__verdict = {"verdict":"STABLE","counts":{"n":10}};</script>', "MPOX_VACCINE_NMA_REVIEW.html")`.  
  Consequence: inherited green verdicts are never hard findings in the CLI/file scan path; only `assert_clean(..., base_path=...)` can detect them.

- **SELECTOR KEYED TO WRONG FORM** — line 506.  
  Input: `<button onclick='RapidMeta.switchTab("protocol")'>T</button><script>const RapidMeta={state:{}};</script>`.  
  Consequence: a single-quoted inline handler is invisible, so the dead control passes.

- **GUARD SATISFIED BY COMMENT** — line 540.  
  Input: `<button onclick="RapidMeta.switchTab('protocol')">T</button><script>const RapidMeta={state:{}}; // switchTab(){}</script>`.  
  Consequence: the comment satisfies `_DEFS`, but `RapidMeta.switchTab` still throws.

- **NAME VS BINDING** — line 540.  
  Input: `<button onclick="RapidMeta.switchTab('protocol')">T</button><script>const RapidMeta={state:{}}; const switchTab = () => null;</script>`.  
  Consequence: a local `switchTab` masks the absent `RapidMeta.switchTab`.

- **DIFFERENT COPY READ AS OWN DATA** — line 249.  
  Input: `<script>const app={realData:{trials:[{nct:'NCT04988048',name:'MVA-BN { brace'}]},KNOWN_TRIAL_ALIASES:{NCT03036124:['base alias']}};</script>`.  
  Consequence: quote-unaware realData scanning absorbs the registry, so `NCT03036124` is treated as the app’s own NCT and the foreign registry passes.

- **TEXT LINE ENDINGS** — line 587.  
  Input: clone payload `{\n"verdict":"STABLE"\n}` versus base payload `{\r\n"verdict":"STABLE"\r\n}`.  
  Consequence: same inherited verdict content is treated as recomputed.

No proven defect found for: probe keyed to string a fix removes; merged-cell/off-by-one; zero conflated with absent; negation dropped; subprocess/pipe wrapper status code.
